<view class="page"><navigation-bar title="重复照片" back="{{false}}" background="#ffffff" color="#1f2329"></navigation-bar><scroll-view class="body" scroll-y show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="wrap"><view class="summary"><view><text class="summary-title">发现 {{total}} 组批次内重复照片</text><text class="summary-sub">确认后预计可整理 {{reclaimText}}</text></view><text class="summary-mark">⌁</text></view><view class="tip">每次上传会独立分析：只有同一次选择的照片才会互相比较。不同次上传的相同照片不会被标记为建议清理。</view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{empty}}"><text class="empty-icon">◎</text><text class="empty-title">还没有重复照片</text><text class="empty-sub">去首页选择照片，开始第一次分析</text><button class="outline" bindtap="goHome">去选择照片</button></view><view class="group-card" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="id" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="openGroup"><view class="group-head"><view><text class="group-title">本批次发现 {{item.count}} 张相同照片</text><text class="group-sub">{{item.batchText}} · 可整理 {{item.reclaimText}}</text></view><text class="group-status {{item.confirmed ? 'done' : ''}}">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><view class="group-thumbs"><view class="group-thumb-wrap" wx:for="{{item.photos}}" wx:for-item="photo" wx:key="id"><image class="group-thumb" src="{{photo.path}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><text class="recommend" wx:if="{{photo.id === item.recommendedKeepId}}">建议保留</text></view></view><text class="group-hint">点击查看并选择保留照片 ›</text></view><view class="safe-space"></view></view></scroll-view><view class="sheet-mask" wx:if="{{selected}}" bindtap="closeGroup"><view class="sheet" catchtap="noop"><view class="sheet-head"><view><text class="sheet-title">选择要保留的照片</text><text class="sheet-sub">{{selected.batchText}} · 仅影响本次上传中的同组照片，其余仅标记为待处理</text></view><text class="sheet-close" bindtap="closeGroup">×</text></view><scroll-view class="sheet-scroll" scroll-y><view class="review-card" wx:for="{{selected.photos}}" wx:key="id"><image class="review-image" src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><view class="review-info"><text class="review-name">本次选择序号 {{item.importIndex + 1}}</text><text class="review-meta">{{item.resolutionText}} · {{item.sizeText}}</text><text class="score">本地质量分 {{item.qualityScore}}</text><text class="badge" style="color:{{item.reviewMeta.color}};background:{{item.reviewMeta.bg}}">{{item.reviewMeta.label}}</text></view><button class="keep-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseKeep">保留</button></view></scroll-view></view></view></view>